GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT

Kingdom of Babba Sissoko (#0):
  In spring, Alain (#33) rode his flying armies over to the Mirkwood Sea.
  A fleet of ships carried the banner of Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango 
(#0) into the Sea province of the Mirkwood Sea, ruled by Circe (#8).  Alain 
(#33)'s forces conquered the Mirkwood Sea without any major engagements.
  In early summer, Alain flew over to Katmai.
  In fall, Alain rode his flying armies over to Katmai.
  An army coming from the empire of Bradipo I (#2) invaded Katmai, hoping to 
conquer that province ruled by Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) and 
made up of extensive Forests.  Bradipo I (#2) commanded the attacking 
armies.  The defending forces were led by Alain (#33).  The defenders turned 
back Bradipo I (#2)'s forces and drove them out of Katmai.
  In late summer, Bagmore (#75) rode his flying armies into the Mirkwood Sea.


Kingdom of Bradipo I (#2):
  In fall, an army coming from the empire of Bradipo I (#2) invaded Katmai, 
hoping to conquer that province ruled by Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango 
(#0) and made up of extensive Forests.  Bradipo I (#2) commanded the 
attacking armies.  The defending forces were led by Alain (#33).  The 
defenders turned back Bradipo I (#2)'s forces and drove them out of Katmai.


Kingdom of Circe (#8):
  In early winter, a fleet of ships carried the banner of 
